---
title: "getLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_lookup: caller queries address by identifier
    q_lookup --> q_return: registry[identifier] != address(0)
    q_lookup --> q_revert: address not found
    q_return --> [*]: return registry[identifier]
    q_revert --> [*]: revert AddressNotFound

    note right of q_lookup
        INV-001: View function (no state modification)
        INV-002: Used by sale contracts during syncLegionAddresses
    end note
